<div class="art-head"><div><div class="up" style="color:#8A8A8A">Beauty · Skincare · K-beauty</div><h1 class="hd">Medicube Zero Pore Pad 2.0 Review: Three Years of Using It</h1><p class="serif stand">This is my Medicube Zero Pore Pad 2.0 review after about three years of on-and-off use. It’s the product I reach for when blackheads and visible pores need attention, and I still keep a jar on my shelf.</p><div class="hand" style="transform:rotate(-2deg);font-size:34px;margin-top:10px">my 3-year staple</div></div>
<div class="img art-hero"><img src="/img/med-official.webp" alt="Medicube Zero Pore Pad 2.0 jar" style="object-fit:contain;background:#fff"></div></div></section>
<section class="p art-grid"><div class="art-body">
<p>Below: how I use it, how often, what it did for my skin, what’s inside, and how it compares with the other pore pad I’ve tried.</p>
<figure class="fig"><img src="/img/med-hands.webp" alt="Hands holding the open jar of Medicube Zero Pore Pad with tongs" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The jar comes with plastic tongs, and the pads sit under a lid.</figcaption></figure>
