<h2>Quick answers</h2>
<h3>Can I use Medicube Zero Pore Pad every day?</h3><p>Yes, I find them gentle enough for daily use. Just don’t rub hard, because the friction can irritate skin.</p>
<h3>Do I need to rinse after using it?</h3><p>No, I don’t rinse. I go straight to hydrating serums and creams.</p>
<h3>Did it make me purge?</h3><p>No, I had no breakouts when I started.</p>
<h3>How often should I use it?</h3><p>I’d use them for 2 to 3 weeks regularly, then 2 to 3 times a week, or once a week as a spot mask.</p>
